# pstack model configuration. One line per role. Delete a line to fall back to the skill default.
# A value is `<model id>-<effort>`. The family is the vendor prefix: claude, gpt, gemini, grok.
# In T3 Code, run an entry from another provider with `delegate_task`: gpt-* on codex, gemini-* and grok-* on cursor. Resolve ids with `orchestrator_capabilities`. Keep the judge read-only.
# Outside T3 Code, an entry the harness cannot spawn counts as rejected.
arena cross-judge pool: claude-opus-5-5-xhigh, gpt-6.2-sol-xhigh, gemini-4-neon-xhigh
